{
  "uid": "sn3.17",
  "title": "",
  "translator": "Bhikkhu Sujato",
  "segments": [
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:0.1",
      "text": "Linked Discourses 3.17"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:0.2",
      "text": "2. Childless"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:0.3",
      "text": "Diligence"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:1.1",
      "text": "At Sāvatthī."
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:1.2",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:1.3",
      "text": "Seated to one side, King Pasenadi said to the Buddha,"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:1.4",
      "text": "\"Sir, is there one thing that secures benefits for both"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:1.5",
      "text": "this life and lives to come?\""
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:2.1",
      "text": "\"There is, Great King.\""
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:2.2",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:3.1",
      "text": "\"So what is that one thing?\""
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:3.2",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:4.1",
      "text": "\"Diligence, Great King, is one thing that secures benefits for both"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:4.2",
      "text": "this life and lives to come."
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:4.3",
      "text": "The footprints of all creatures that walk can fit inside an elephant's footprint. So an elephant's footprint is said to be the biggest of them all."
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:4.4",
      "text": "In the same way, diligence is one thing that secures benefits for both"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:4.5",
      "text": "this life and lives to come.\""
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:4.6",
      "text": "That is what the Buddha said. …"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:5.1",
      "text": "\"For one who desires high delights"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:5.2",
      "text": "again and again—"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:5.3",
      "text": "long life, beauty, and health,"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:5.4",
      "text": "heaven, and an eminent family—"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:6.1",
      "text": "the astute praise diligence"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:6.2",
      "text": "in making merit."
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:6.3",
      "text": "Being diligent, an astute person"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:6.4",
      "text": "secures both benefits:"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:7.1",
      "text": "the benefit in this life,"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:7.2",
      "text": "and in lives to come."
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:7.3",
      "text": "An attentive one, comprehending the meaning,"
    },
    {
      "uid": "sn3.17:7.4",
      "text": "is said to be astute.\""
    }
  ]
}
